<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Winterthur.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Winterthur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Winterthur Insurance Co, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,400 CHF		 PREMIUM	19.86 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.42 CHF		  GEARING	10.49 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.MAR.99		 PAYDATE	01.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,269 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
